Hi,

Last night I hacked alsamixer to be a bit more cute.  The patch is
attached below.  The patch also includes some fixes.

With this change, the mute and capture indicators are moved below the
volume bars, which IMO is easier and more understandable.  You can
concentrate on the bottom area.

If you have any objections/comments on this change, please let me
know.  If it seems OK, I'll commit it to CVS later.


Takashi

--Multipart_Wed_Dec_29_14:22:35_2004-1
